WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Alleviate means to ease; synonyms are relieve and soothe.. Pivotal means

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.500
critically important; a synonym is crucial.. Inherent means built into the

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.500
nature of something.. Ambiguous means open to more than one meaning.. Coherent

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.500
means logical and easy to follow.. A discrepancy is a mismatch between two

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.500
things.. Innovative means new in approach; a synonym is novel.. Controversial

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.500
means causing strong disagreement.. Sustainable means able to continue without

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:55.500
harm.. Inevitable means certain to happen..
